# Local backup archives - DECISION (2026-08-10): .archive/ folders hold
# point-in-time backups managed by HashCheck + workspace-backup.cmd
# (Neural-Net\scripts\powershell\file-integrity\workspace-backup\workspace-backup.cmd),
# NOT by git. They must never enter git history or get pushed to GitHub.
# Before this rule existed, some repos (Neural-Net, MTBank) had already
# committed .archive/ content - those were untracked with `git rm --cached`
# alongside adding this line; the files remain on disk, just no longer
# tracked. This does not rewrite existing history in those repos.
.archive/

